# Gargul Comm Traces

Given output starting with `Gargul comm trace | v...`, read `.agents/reference/commtrace.md`
first. It decodes every field and already holds the conclusions — don't re-derive them from
`CommRecorder.lua`, `Comm.lua` and `ChatThrottleLib.lua`.
